    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="7[a]">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Hl">Hl</ref> 7[a]</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif man oþrum mæn feoh forstele, ⁊ se agend hit eft ætfo, geteme to cynges sele gif he mæge, ⁊ þone æt gebrenge þe him sealde.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If a person steals property from another person, and the owner afterwards takes possession of it, let him [the accused] vouch in the king’s hall, if he is able, and bring him who sold it to him.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif man oþrum mæn feoh forstele, ⁊ se agend hit eft ætfó, geteme to cynges sele, gif he mæge, ⁊ þone ætgebrenge þe him sealde;</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
